        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Social Hx:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " social service records (interviews w the pt, family and others) assess home plans, family attitudes and community resource contacts, and incl a Social Hx."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
